cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, dataset, or software, please cite this repository
  using the metadata below. Please also cite PubChem as described in the README.
type: software
title: "Name2SMILES Dataset: A PubChem Name-to-SMILES Benchmark"
authors:
  - name: GoldenFern
    website: "https://github.com/GoldenFern"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoldenFern/name2smiles-bench"
url: "https://github.com/GoldenFern/name2smiles-bench"
abstract: >-
  A PubChem-derived name-to-SMILES benchmark with coverage-aware dataset
  selection, a 100-record mini set, RDKit structure scoring, and a
  provider-agnostic language-model evaluation client.
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - SMILES
  - PubChem
  - RDKit
  - language-model evaluation
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
